|---------|--------------|------|------|
| **Based on** | Hash/Cipher | Hash function | Block cipher |
| **Standard** | General | RFC 2104 | NIST SP 800-38B |
| **Key** | Secret key | Secret key + ipad/opad | Secret key + subkeys |
| **Algorithm** | Any | MD5/SHA with 2 rounds | AES/3DES in CBC |
| **Variable length msg** | Depends | ✅ Safe | ✅ Safe |
| **Length Extension** | Vulnerable | ✅ Protected | ✅ Protected |
| **Speed** | Fast | Moderate | Moderate |
| **Hardware use** | Depends | Software | Hardware-friendly |
| **Applications** | General | TLS, JWT, APIs | AES-based systems |

