### 📌 Hash Function Properties — Memory Trick

> **"Very Easy Pre-image Collision Pseudo"**  
> → **V**ariable input, **E**fficient, **P**re-image resistant, **C**ollision resistant, **P**seudo-random + Fixed output, 2nd Pre-image resistant

