### 📌 HMAC Formula

```
HMAC(K, M) = H [ (K ⊕ opad) || H [ (K ⊕ ipad) || M ] ]

ipad = 0x36 (repeated)
opad = 0x5C (repeated)
```

---

### 📌 CMAC Subkey Generation Memory Trick

```
L = E(K, 0)
MSB(L)=0 → K1 = L << 1
MSB(L)=1 → K1 = (L<<1) XOR Rb

Same logic L→K1, K1→K2

Last block complete → use K1
Last block incomplete → use K2 (pad with 10...0 first)
```

